    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index dropped below the 5,000 point mark for the first time since September, down by 540 points week-on-week to 4,845. The W.Australia-Qingdao iron ore spot voyage rate fell by $1.00/t to $7.85/t, while the round-voyage rate dropped by $4,650/day to $8,000/day.",
